Package: glydb
Title: Glycan Structure Database
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Bin", "Fu", , "23110220018@m.fudan.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8567-2997"))
Description: Provides a comprehensive database of glycan structures from GlyTouCan,
    including fully determined glycan structures with complete linkage, substituent,
    anomer, and monosaccharide information. This database serves as a foundational
    resource for the glycoverse ecosystem, enabling glycan structure analysis,
    comparison, and research applications. 
